'''Volkanos Volcano''' (ボルケーノ火山 ''Borukēno Kazan,'' '''Volcano Volcano''') is the 10th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 4th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Easy until the last two stages, which can be some of the most difficult for a while. Each stage is different from the last, and so the player may have to change up their loadouts a lot. The hard stages in this sub-chapter include [[Volcanic Defender]] ([[Teacher Bun Bun]] appears early on, along with [[Shy Boy]]s) and [[Flame Caldera]] ([[Kory]]'s introduction).
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Kory]]: A moderately tough [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy with high health, mediocre range and several knockbacks. What makes him dangerous is his ability to perform [[Wave Attack]]s (Lv. 4, to be specific), which will happen a lot if the player risks spamming short-ranged cats against him. It is also important to note that the first time Kory appears, he is buffed to 200%.

