==Trivia==
*The Japanese name of this sub-chapter is literally the English word "volcano" (ボルケーノ ''borukēno'') followed by the Japanese word of the same meaning (火山 ''kazan''). If the name were translated into English more directly, it would be called Kazan Volcano.

